    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>Adds a reCaptcha™ to your Mailster subscription forms.</p>\n<p>You may also try <a href=\"https://wordpress.org/plugins/mailster-cool-captcha/\" rel=\"ugc\">Mailster Cool Captcha for Forms</a></p>\n<h3>Additional Info</h3>\n<p>This Plugin requires <a href=\"https://mailster.co/?utm_campaign=wporg&amp;utm_source=wordpress.org&amp;utm_medium=readme&amp;utm_term=reCaptcha\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Mailster Newsletter Plugin for WordPress</a></p>\n",
        "installation": "<ol>\n<li>Upload the entire <code>mailster-recaptcha</code> folder to the <code>/wp-content/plugins/</code> directory</li>\n<li>Activate the plugin through the &#8216;Plugins&#8217; menu in WordPress</li>\n<li>Go to Settings =&gt; Newsletter =&gt; reCaptcha™ and configure the plugin</li>\n</ol>\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>2.0.2</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>improved: packaging and release pipeline for WordPress.org</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>2.0.1</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>fixed: issue with latest block forms plugin not shoing settings page</li>\n<li>tested: up to WordPress 6.3</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>2.0.0</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Supports now Mailster Block Forms</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.6</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>only output script if form has been rendered.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.5</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>updated file structure</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.4.1</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>fixed: problem with confirmation if add on is enabled</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.4</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>fixed: submitting form with with removed captcha field is no longer possible</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.3</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>allow multiple forms on a single page (thanks to A. Grundner)</li>\n<li>small code improvements</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.2</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>added: support for reCpatcha API v3 (default)</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.1.1</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>fixed: script tag not shown on HTML forms</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.1</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>removed option for V1</li>\n<li>added theme selection</li>\n<li>added size selection</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.0.1</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>fixed: issue where check box doesn&#8217;t get recognized</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.0</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>initial release</li>\n</ul>\n"
    },
